  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;rate&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Case-1:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>&#8776;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>rate&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced></mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; (Zero order w.r.t. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/dfd719b5-fdeb-4cb1-9ce2-423daaafee1f-image.png\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 142px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/e9e7ebc4-703c-4316-a90b-e794bf7f2290-image.png\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 137px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Case-2:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8810;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>&#8776;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;rate&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mi>st</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;order w.r.t. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math></p><p>Case-3:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8776;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></msub></math></p><p>rate&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>In this case curve-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math>&nbsp;given in List-II will match.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math>&nbsp; (The graph of half-life should start from origin)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>II</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;rate&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8810;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8776;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp; rate&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp; (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mi>st</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;order w.r.t. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>II</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/01e32ef2-6a7f-4001-9d08-bc5374761a2e-image.png\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 144px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/fc324932-d185-45c7-a83e-8e7bb417b98b-image.png\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 143px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>III</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp; rate&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X